{
  "id": "longest-unique-substring",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "title": "不含重复字符的最长子串",
  "descriptionLines": [
    "给定一个字符串 s，请找出其中不包含重复字符的最长子串的长度。",
    "",
    "要求：",
    "1. 子串必须是连续的字符序列。",
    "2. 区分大小写，'a' 与 'A' 视为不同字符。",
    "3. 字符串可能为空，此时返回 0。",
    "",
    "函数签名：lengthOfLongestSubstring(s)",
    "返回值示例：s = 'abcabcbb' 时，最长无重复子串是 'abc'，返回 3"
  ],
  "functionName": "lengthOfLongestSubstring",
  "paramNames": [
    "s"
  ],
  "approachExplanation": "滑动窗口 + 哈希表：维护窗口 [start, i]，用哈希表记录每个字符最近一次出现的下标。右指针每前进一位，若当前字符上次出现位置落在窗口内，则把左边界收缩到该位置 + 1，保证窗口内始终无重复字符。过程中记录窗口长度的最大值。每个字符最多被访问两次，时间复杂度 O(n)。",
  "referenceSolutionLines": [
    "function lengthOfLongestSubstring(s) {",
    "  const last = new Map();",
    "  let start = 0;",
    "  let best = 0;",
    "  for (let i = 0; i < s.length; i++) {",
    "    const ch = s[i];",
    "    const prev = last.get(ch);",
    "    if (prev !== undefined && prev >= start) start = prev + 1;",
    "    last.set(ch, i);",
    "    if (i - start + 1 > best) best = i - start + 1;",
    "  }",
    "  return best;",
    "}"
  ],
  "expectedOutputs": [
    3,
    3,
    1,
    0,
    2,
    3
  ],
  "testInputs": [
    {
      "input": [
        "abcabcbb"
      ],
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "input": [
        "pwwkew"
      ],
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "input": [
        "bbbbb"
      ],
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "input": [
        ""
      ],
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "input": [
        "aab"
      ],
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "input": [
        "dvdf"
      ],
      "hidden": true
    }
  ]
}
